# Prettier reads the ignore file in the directory it runs from, so this repeats the root's
# rule for runs from here (pnpm --filter, or a shell in docs/site): Prettier formats MDX as
# MDX 1 did, reflowing text inside JSX onto lines of its own, which MDX 3 reads as
# paragraphs (and splits links and sentences).
src/content/**/*.mdx

